<title>UK: Winterthur details Sfr convertible bond.</title>
<headline>Winterthur details Sfr convertible bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Details of the following equity-linked issue have been announced by lead manager Credit Suisse First Boston.</p>
<p> BORROWER   WINTERTHUR INSURANCE CO</p>
<p> AMT    399.5 MLN SFR COUPON  ** 2.25 PCT  MATURITY    28.FEB.00</p>
<p> TYPE   CONVERTIBLE   ISS PRICE  PAR	 PAY DATE    28.FEB.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  =	   PREMIUM    20.05     EOS	   31.JAN.97</p>
<p> NOTES     **COUPON PAYMENTS WILL BE SUSPENDED IF MORE THAN</p>
<p>		6,000 HAIL OR STORM BASED INSURANCE CLAIMS HAVE TO</p>
<p>		BE COVERED.</p>
<p>		CONVERSION PERIOD - 18.FEB.00-24.FEB.00</p>
<p>		CONVERSION PRICE 940 SFR, CLOSING 783 SFR</p>
<p>		5 SHARES PER BOND</p>
<p>-- LONDON NEWSROOM +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
